    "societal_benefit": {
      "en": "The maker world has fractured into rival organization grids — Gridfinity for drawers, Multiboard and pegboard for walls, French cleats for tools — and a bin or holder built for one will not mount on another, forcing a rebuild per system. As the Commons' #300 keystone, this hub is the single adapter that bridges them: it lets a Gridfinity bin hang on a cleat wall, a pegboard carry a Gridfinity cell, or a Multiboard meet Gridfinity — so the whole catalog of parts becomes mountable anywhere, and no one is locked into a single grid.",
      "es": "El mundo maker se ha fracturado en cuadrículas rivales — Gridfinity para cajones, Multiboard y panel perforado para paredes, cuñas francesas para herramientas — y un contenedor hecho para una no se monta en otra, obligando a rehacerlo por sistema. Como piedra angular #300 del Commons, este hub es el adaptador único que las une: permite colgar un contenedor Gridfinity en una pared de cuña, que un panel lleve una celda Gridfinity, o que Multiboard encuentre Gridfinity — para que todo el catálogo sea montable en cualquier lugar."
